## 📥 Installation

### New Installation
```bash
pip install cloudsync==2.5.0
cloudsync init
```

### Upgrade from v2.4
```bash
pip install --upgrade cloudsync==2.5.0
cloudsync migrate --from=2.4 --to=2.5
```

**Note:** Backward compatible. Existing configurations work without modification (except Python 3.8 requirement).

